# Sylos-owned OAuth apps (non-Google). Values are stored as enc:… using oauth.key.
# The key and ciphertext are both committed; a release binary can recover the
# plain values. This only avoids plaintext secrets in git history / casual scans.
# Admins can still override apps in Settings. Google Drive is not listed here
# (bring-your-own-app).
#
# To update: put plaintext on the right-hand side, then run `make oauth-encrypt`.
# Leave a line blank to skip seeding that provider.

SYLOS_DROPBOX_CLIENT_ID?=enc:UXYPRAWZzTUJxLg2InQ8pBuBZkMzmW3g7xN9SZdAYkcVoiiULaXEMYKhiA
